      "id": "flow:propose_redirect_flow",
      "data": {
        "name": "propose_redirect_flow",
        "description": "Step 1 of 2 to redirect a parcel to a pickup point (locker or staffed shop). Give the tracking number and the chosen pickup_id. The system checks every rule (ownership, the parcel is still redirectable, the pickup point serves the parcel&#39;s area and fits its size, and - for unattended lockers - that the parcel is not signature-required and not over the value limit) and returns PROPOSED with an action_id, or NOT_PROPOSED with the reason. Nothing changes until confirm_redirect is called.",
