    {
      "id": "flow:email_confirmation_flow",
      "data": {
        "name": "email_confirmation_flow",
        "description": "Email the recipient the confirmation for a reschedule or redirect they have already executed. Pass the action_id from confirm_reschedule or confirm_redirect. The system sends the email only when that change belongs to this session and has been executed; otherwise it returns NOT_SENT with the reason. Call only after a successful change.",
